{"product":{"id":8978643878142,"title":"APPLIED NUTRITION Critical Whey Protein 2KG","body_html":"\u003ch2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold\"\u003eApplied Nutrition Critical Whey Protein – 2kg\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eA premium daily \u003cstrong\u003ewhey protein\u003c\/strong\u003e built around a multi-source dairy blend — designed for serious lifters, athletes, active adults, and anyone whose daily protein intake is the foundation of their muscle building, recovery, or body composition goals. Particularly suited to those wanting a more credible alternative to budget single-source whey concentrate, lifters running heavy training programmes, anyone whose current protein sits at a poor protein-to-calorie ratio, and people seeking the highest level of third-party banned-substance testing available.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhat separates Applied Nutrition Critical Whey from the typical whey product on the market comes down to protein blend quality and macro efficiency. Each serving delivers 24g of high-quality protein from a scientifically-formulated four-source blend: Whey Protein Concentrate, Whey Protein Isolate, Hydrolysed Whey, and Milk Protein Concentrate — all sourced from grass-fed dairy. This blend matters because each protein source absorbs at a different rate: hydrolysed whey is the fastest, isolate and concentrate are moderate, and the milk protein concentrate (which includes casein) is slower-digesting. The result is a sustained amino acid release curve rather than a single rapid spike that dissipates within an hour — meaningful for post-workout recovery and overnight protein support. The macro profile is equally important: 24g of protein at just 120 calories per serving delivers an exceptional protein-to-calorie ratio that fits both bulking and cutting phases. The product is also Informed Protein tested for protein accuracy (the actual protein content matches the label) — a meaningful detail in a market where some commodity products underdeliver on stated protein. Available in flavours tested as Informed-Sport certified (Chocolate Milkshake, Strawberry Milkshake, Vanilla Ice Cream), giving competing athletes confidence in batch-by-batch banned-substance testing.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eApplied Nutrition manufactures Critical Whey in the UK in facilities certified to \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https:\/\/www.who.int\/health-topics\/good-manufacturing-practices\"\u003eGMP\u003c\/a\u003e standards, with rigorous quality control across the range. Importantly, every batch is \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https:\/\/sport.wetestyoutrust.com\/\"\u003eInformed Sport\u003c\/a\u003e tested — meaning batches are independently tested for WADA-banned substances at an ISO 17025 accredited lab. For competing tested-pool athletes in Sri Lanka, that's the highest level of third-party verification available.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"[li_\u0026amp;]:mb-0 [li_\u0026amp;]:mt-1 [li_\u0026amp;]:gap-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e24g of high-quality protein per serving\u003c\/strong\u003e at just 120 calories — exceptional protein-to-calorie ratio for bulking or cutting\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFour-source dairy blend\u003c\/strong\u003e — Whey Concentrate, \u003cstrong\u003eWhey Protein Isolate\u003c\/strong\u003e, Hydrolysed Whey, and Milk Protein Concentrate for sustained amino acid release\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGrass-fed dairy sourcing\u003c\/strong\u003e — clean ingredient origin across the protein base\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e61 servings per 2kg tub\u003c\/strong\u003e — two months of daily supply for most serious lifters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInformed Sport certified flavours available\u003c\/strong\u003e — the highest third-party verification, strong value at the \u003cstrong\u003ewhey protein price in Sri Lanka\u003c\/strong\u003e category\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003ePair it with a quality creatine or recovery supplement from our \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"\/collections\/protein-powder\"\u003eprotein and recovery range\u003c\/a\u003e to round out a complete training and recovery stack.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Applied Nutrition","product_type":"WHEY PROTEIN","created_at":"2025-09-02T23:18:30+05:30","handle":"applied-nutrition-critical-whey-2kg","updated_at":"2026-10-18T01:25:48+05:30","published_at":"2025-09-02T23:29:17+05:30","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"global","tags":"WHEY PROTEIN BLEND","variants":[{"id":47243287920894,"product_id":8978643878142,"title":"61 Servings \/ Chocolate Milkshake - Informed-Sport Tested","price":"31999.00","sku":null,"position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":